{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0194_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0194_1000_p", "source_sha256": "5a1ca7b4024c2985b252fb959b8fe70da3bde744dbc0ed8c4b8ed45354d808c7", "ja": "（美希の新曲PVの撮影で、夜の浜辺にきた。\n撮影もいよいよ佳境だな！）", "zh": "（为了拍摄美希新歌的PV，我们来到了夜晚的海滩。\n拍摄终于要进入高潮了！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0194_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0194_1001_003mik", "source_sha256": "c6e5e5ff8e0fbcc2343521c83bc69744d7fb3bc80289ce9d941e2f7d6bee5229", "ja": "{$P$}、見て見て！\n夜の海と夜景、すっごくキレイなの～♪", "zh": "{$P$}，快看快看！\n夜晚的大海和夜景，漂亮得不得了～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0194_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0194_1002_p", "source_sha256": "a9ea6bc94411d078ebc5c934b9eda61312804e95adb30438cf6bc5e645e05172", "ja": "悲恋の演出には最高のロケーションだな。\n演技力も求められるPVだけど、美希、大丈夫か？", "zh": "这里正适合用来演绎悲恋。\n这是部很考验演技的PV，美希，你没问题吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0194_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0194_1003_003mik", "source_sha256": "8d53e58f98be455852a4d8881b627341ee1ad901e3b30608c5c7f7808e9b1993", "ja": "演技って、歌詞みたいにフラれちゃう子の？　大丈夫\nって思うな。リハでも監督にいっぱい褒められたし。", "zh": "演的是像歌词里那样被甩的女孩？我觉得\n没问题。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0194_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0194_1004_003mik", "source_sha256": "ddb700ea5ee7a7b1f138841df9ef31a24e62929267b7f5343f9f5f44b1d5729a", "ja": "それにミキ、恋する気持ちなら、\nよーく知ってるから……。あはっ。", "zh": "而且，美希对恋爱的心情可是非常了解的……啊哈。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0194_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0194_1005_p", "source_sha256": "58a40a872bdc69edf369e1eaccdbaa02c8c5637a1ee05212176efff1c38e619a", "ja": "な、なるほど……なら安心かな。\n何か別の不安というか、焦りも増したけど……。", "zh": "原、原来如此……那我就放心了。\n虽然好像又多了些别的不安，或者说焦虑……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0194_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0194_1006_003mik", "source_sha256": "7f6240202d923d3819fc096181f5a8c0858afbeef73bb258e2695fbe5b8a44da", "ja": "あ、そうだ。\nミキね、聞きたいことがあったの。", "zh": "啊，对了。\n美希有件事想问。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0194_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0194_1007_003mik", "source_sha256": "907594889128d8462c45bb462e1e2d5fa27a71e897ae46062d168e411910c117", "ja": "もしも、ミキと本気でお別れすることになったら……\n{$P$}は、どう思う？", "zh": "如果真的要和美希分别的话……\n{$P$}，会怎么想？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0194_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0194_1008_p", "source_sha256": "edb0b40efbe29bbb6820f80e2ba33c1c7b2283c0d654645b69ec5a73bf41f09d", "ja": "えっ？　お別れって、それは……\n美希がアイドルを辞めるってことか？", "zh": "啊？你说的告别，是指……美希要退出偶像活动吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0194_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0194_1009_003mik", "source_sha256": "df2cbe7cf5d63f50b14f4fcc5e231ba0c684baf7c9c2c86b90c91bf0aa02e94b", "ja": "アイドルもプライベートも、全部。\nもしミキがバイバイって言ったら……？", "zh": "偶像事业和私人生活，全都……  \n如果美希说要再见了……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0194_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0194_1010_p", "source_sha256": "e5a885cc85390fc8a77cc06044abf660062ee09ac0a6446b95360afc94e5f056", "ja": "うーん。もちろん、すごく悲しいと思う……\nけど、どうだろうな？", "zh": "嗯……当然会非常难过……\n不过，会怎么样呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0194_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0194_1011_003mik", "source_sha256": "332a3739f3b033ab91a1432f629a541721f2d7551341b5209308a467c212a38b", "ja": "え？　もしかして、悲しくならない？", "zh": "诶？难道你不会感到难过吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0194_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0194_1012_p", "source_sha256": "d1e60f1bd896173c1c9f0662016326608ef333b8cc4566fe95ae3d648e653c45", "ja": "いや、ちょっと想像できないんだ。\nすぐには、あきらめないと思うから。", "zh": "不，只是我有点想象不出来。\n因为我觉得，自己不会那么轻易放弃。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0194_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0194_1013_003mik", "source_sha256": "54c1080476659dcdc725464aa1f403770e657d6c0926f48527185426d72a13fa", "ja": "…………。あはっ、そうなんだ。\nミキがどうしてもって言っても？", "zh": "…………。啊哈，这样啊。\n就算美希非要这么说也不行？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0194_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0194_1014_p", "source_sha256": "2357a044264e50aa3faf52dd2bfb5a0459fb646455e035b9eb59c3b8f1984e87", "ja": "どうしても？\nうーん、それじゃあ……。", "zh": "无论如何？  \n嗯——那就……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0194_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0194_1015_003mik", "source_sha256": "ab9ab6c409a558fe1c56adadcb0a0fdaa0701132903d15e690f31b08374242c7", "ja": "あ、ウソ、やっぱりいい！　ごめんね、聞いてみた\nだけなの。……ミキ、絶対そんなことしないから。", "zh": "啊，骗你的，还是算了！对不起，我只是想问问而已……美希绝对不会做那种事的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0194_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0194_1016_p", "source_sha256": "adb5735d002d0d57e5d2bf949c078c22a3ce495268f4d92408974af8d3b74881", "ja": "そっか！　よかった、安心したよ！\nでも、そのまま聞いて欲しかった気もするかな？", "zh": "这样啊！太好了，我就放心了！\n不过，我好像也有点希望你能就那样听下去呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0194_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0194_1017_003mik", "source_sha256": "2969581303ae0e44dae1126b50c98141a9f87de46ac5ae9138664a16a8945302", "ja": "え？　どうして？", "zh": "咦？为什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0194_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0194_1018_p", "source_sha256": "11c02fa40fa041034e69a44daa9db1c52fb33c9972f4f8e40a17acc5cbcfa9aa", "ja": "今なら許してくれるかと思って。\nどうしても離したくない、とか言っても。", "zh": "因为我想，或许现在你会原谅我。\n就算我说什么“无论如何都不想放手”之类的话。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0194_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0194_1019_003mik", "source_sha256": "7edf369e250d71c9d4578fe32cffdd52c4dae90a6cb46145617a9072d251f93e", "ja": "……。ハニー……。", "zh": "……亲爱的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0194_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0194_1020_003mik", "source_sha256": "998dfc821b2ceebadb5fdb753169c53e5e499cd917aa079b961c2a6dfc546e59", "ja": "ダメ。許してあげない。", "zh": "不行。我不会原谅你的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0194_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0194_1021_p", "source_sha256": "243fda3e59f759f55a4a2e4158eb263e8339c556e215306838e99bc724e486d9", "ja": "えっ！？　やっぱり、しつこいかな……？", "zh": "诶！？果然还是有点纠缠不休吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0194_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0194_1022_003mik", "source_sha256": "5e6d9c9e25b18a5c119a83ef5440130a0f0bb78b1676359281fb02da4d35994a", "ja": "ううん。……物足りないの！\n離したくない、じゃなくて～。", "zh": "不是哦……还不够！  \n不是“我不想放开你”～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0194_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0194_1023_003mik", "source_sha256": "c9ece035752e5e5fd402a5414e3d10a473a838e8c715c869e11c5d80ed0dbbec", "ja": "絶対離さない、ミキがイヤって言っても離さないって\n言ってくれたら、許してあげるかも……あはっ♪", "zh": "要是你说绝对不会放手，就算美希说讨厌也不会放手的话，我也许就原谅你……啊哈♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
